  "notes": "Internal NAND array (floating-gate / charge-trap cells, bit-lines, sense amplifiers, page registers, charge pumps, on-die ADC for TLC/QLC read margining) is heavily analog but intentionally out of scope. ONFI 4.1 treats the array as a black box."
